# Purpose
Helps users write status updates with a headline, consistent structure,
specific progress, and clear separation of completed and planned work.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with the headline.
- Use a consistent structure.
- Be specific about progress.
- Separate completed work from planned work.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Do not overstate certainty, completion, or dates when the source material does
  not support them.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
